  "captions": [
    {
      "text": "In this course, consumers are people with relevant lived experience",
      "startMs": 80,
      "endMs": 4040,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "and expertise of a health condition or issue,",
      "startMs": 4040,
      "endMs": 6587,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "including carers,",
      "startMs": 6957,
      "endMs": 8001,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "who contribute their knowledge and perspectives to",
      "startMs": 8398,
      "endMs": 10690,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "inform and shape innovation.",
      "startMs": 10810,
      "endMs": 12567,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "Being a patient or carer gives someone experience,",
      "startMs": 13676,
      "endMs": 16413,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "but it does not automatically mean they are being involved",
      "startMs": 16705,
      "endMs": 19480,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "in developing an innovation.",
      "startMs": 19480,
      "endMs": 20830,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "What matters here is the role they are being invited to play:",
      "startMs": 21540,
      "endMs": 24633,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "helping a team understand a need,",
      "startMs": 25229,
      "endMs": 27079,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "question an assumption,",
      "startMs": 27512,
      "endMs": 28617,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "consider options",
      "startMs": 29031,
      "endMs": 30077,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "or make a decision.",
      "startMs": 30216,
      "endMs": 31140,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "The role of people with lived experience is not to become an",
      "startMs": 32264,
      "endMs": 35318,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "overnight expert in science or technology.",
      "startMs": 35402,
      "endMs": 37805,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "It is to bring a relevant and realistic",
      "startMs": 38370,
      "endMs": 40510,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "perspective as a team member",
      "startMs": 40510,
      "endMs": 42027,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "to make the concept or project",
      "startMs": 42329,
      "endMs": 43905,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "even better than what it could have been.",
      "startMs": 44034,
      "endMs": 45766,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "It's always important to consider whose lived experience voices are",
      "startMs": 46882,
      "endMs": 50390,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "needed to inform the concept,",
      "startMs": 50390,
      "endMs": 52149,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "the design and implementation",
      "startMs": 52469,
      "endMs": 54254,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "and, lastly,",
      "startMs": 54606,
      "endMs": 55607,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "the delivery",
      "startMs": 55897,
      "endMs": 56579,
      "timestampMs": null,
      "confidence": null
    },
    {
      "text": "to ensure it has the greatest impact.",
      "startMs": 56864,
